    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22443" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλωσσό-κομος</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sarcophagus</i>, <i><span class="en">
