				17.235
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Pamphylia</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>surgical instrument</i>, used for reducing fractures and
			dislocations, <i><span class="en">
